      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait i see what u mean about the resource arn. i think the issue might be the resource line. if i'm writing files to the bucket, do i need to add /* to the end of the bucket name in the arn? like \"arn:aws:s3:::my-app-logs-bucket/*\"? i always get confused if i should point to the bucket itself or the objects inside it.",
