      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks that worked. the /* fixed it. \n\none more thing though—it's weird because everything looked correct and it felt like it should have just worked. why is aws so finicky about these tiny little details like a slash? it feels like there's some hidden logic i'm missing where it just randomly blocks things for no reason.",
